ing, and competing with modded features.\n\n4.\nA competitive VR movement experience featuring fast climbing mechanics, custom mods, and multiplayer action.\n\n5. (Shortest)\nA competitive VR climbing game with custom mods and skill-based movement.", "short_description": "1.\nA fast-paced VR climbing game where players compete, use custom mods, and test their movement skills against others.\n\n2.\nA competitive VR movement game with custom mods, unique mechanics, and intense player battles.\n\n3.\nA skill-based VR parkour game focused on climbing, chasing, and competing with modded features.\n\n4.\nA competitive VR movement experience featuring fast climbing mechanics, custom mods, and multiplayer action."}]}, "developer_name": "Ky", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/zip-tag?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ky", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/zip-tagwebsite?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1215493968316867"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673522158_1381838663900475_4562209227483462763_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FOeCLuje5AsQ7kNvwH7oCBa&_nc_oc=AdpNGK604hb